==English==
[[File:Geschirrtuch am Haken 2 fcm.jpg|thumb|upright|A green '''tea cloth''']]

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|tea|cloth}}; originally designating a cloth for wiping tea service items after washing, later a small tablecloth useful for afternoon tea. Attested from the late 18th century. Compare later {{m|en|tea towel}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}
# A [[tea towel]].
# A small [[tablecloth]].

